      ":question/math-academy-id": "q-161084",
      ":question/problem": "Consider the finite region $D$ enclosed in the first quadrant of the $xy$-plane between the lines and curves \n\n$$\nx=y,\\,x=5y,\\,{e}^{x}=\\frac{2}{{e}^{y}},\\,{e}^{x}=\\frac{7}{{e}^{y}}.\n$$\n\nA transformation $T,$ where\n\n$$\nT:(u,v)\\to (x(u,v),y(u,v)),\n$$\n\nmaps a rectangular region $\u0394$ with sides parallel to the $u$- and $v$-axes from the $uv$-plane onto $D$ in the $xy$-plane. Given that\n\n$$\nT:(u,v)\\to (\\frac{u\\operatorname{ln}\u2061v}{u+1},\\,\\,),\n$$\n\nwhat could be the missing expression?"
